        ":question/problem": "Find the equation of the normal line to the curve $y=2 x^{2} - 2 x + 2$ at $\\left(2,6\\right)$.\n\nGive exact values of $a$ and $b$ in $x+ay=b$.\n\n$a=$ {{coefficient}}\n\n$b=$ {{constant}}",
